    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Zombie Breakdown</strong> is a role-playing game (RPG) with an open world and an Active Time Battle (ATB) System!  </h2>The world is in disarray. There is pervasive chaos, people are disappearing one by one and the streets are in the blood. The world needs a hero, someone to save humanity from extinction. And this is the job for you. Do what you can to stop the zombie apocalypse. Along with other humans still alive, take on increasingly dangerous missions, but beware. Zombies could be lurking around every corner.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Many Quests<br></li><li>Many Cutscenes<br></li><li>Many locations<br></li><li>Open World elements<br></li><li>Active Time Battle System</li></ul>",
